The parties hereby amend the Master Service Agreement dated {{date: 2026-03-01}} (the
"Agreement" {{def: amended-agreement}}) as follows. Capitalised terms not defined here have the
meaning given in the {{term: amended-agreement}}.

# Payment Terms {#amend-payment}

Section 4.1 of the Agreement is amended to read as follows:

> Each Client shall pay the fees within {{duration: 15, unit=D}} of the date of the relevant
> invoice. Late payments bear interest at {{money: 250, currency=USD, note=Fixed daily charge}}
> per day of delay.

# Data Protection {#amend-data-protection}

The following new Article is added after Article 6 of the Agreement:

"Personal Data" {{def: personal-data}} means any information relating to an identified or
identifiable natural person that the Provider processes in performing the {{term: services}}.

The Provider shall process all {{term: personal-data}} in accordance with applicable data
protection laws and only on documented instructions from the relevant Client.

# Service Levels {#amend-service-levels}

The restoration target for non-critical defects in Schedule A of the Agreement is reduced from
{{duration: 2, unit=W}} to {{duration: 5, unit=D}}.

# Unchanged Provisions {#amend-unchanged}

All other terms and conditions of the Agreement remain in full force and effect.
